flowchart TD
    CHANGE[Proposed DPA or governance change]
    CLASS[Classify change class]
    RISK[Assign risk R0 through R5]

    R0[R0 mechanical]
    R1[R1 editorial]
    R2[R2 derived synchronization]
    R3[R3 bounded semantic]
    R4[R4 high-impact semantic]
    R5[R5 adoption or strict enforcement]

    FAST[Fast mechanical path]
    EDIT[Editorial path]
    SYNC[Synchronization path]
    AMEND[Bounded amendment path]
    FULL[Full governed review path]
    ADOPT[Adoption or strict-enforcement path]

    EQUIV[Diff-scoped equivalence verification]
    IND[Independent-context verification]
    BLIND[Blind-first evaluation before finding-closure mapping]
    CHECKS[Deterministic consistency checks]
    MAINT[Maintainer adjudication]
    PROBES[Exact-ref Probes and Assessment]
    RECORD[Review-economy record]
    PASS[Status-only promotion or accepted disposition]
    BLOCK[Escalate, block or fall back to full review]

    CHANGE --> CLASS --> RISK
    RISK --> R0
    RISK --> R1
    RISK --> R2
    RISK --> R3
    RISK --> R4
    RISK --> R5

    R0 --> FAST --> CHECKS --> RECORD
    R1 --> EDIT --> CHECKS --> RECORD
    R2 --> SYNC --> CHECKS --> RECORD
    R3 --> AMEND --> MAINT --> IND
    R4 --> FULL --> MAINT --> IND
    R5 --> ADOPT --> PROBES --> MAINT --> IND
    IND -->|R4/R5 or primary finding closure| BLIND --> RECORD
    IND -->|other lower-risk verification| RECORD

    SYNC -->|semantic-preserving claim| EQUIV
    AMEND -->|post-verification rewrite| EQUIV
    FULL -->|restructure recovery| EQUIV
    EQUIV -->|PASS| RECORD
    EQUIV -->|cannot bound| BLOCK

    CHECKS -->|failure| BLOCK
    MAINT -->|rejected or deferred| BLOCK
    IND -->|independence blocked or fail| BLOCK
    BLIND -->|anchored before blind-first| BLOCK
    PROBES -->|missing or blocked| BLOCK

    RECORD --> PASS
    BLOCK --> FULL

    NOTE1[No review-cost shortcut may reduce required assurance]
    NOTE2[Generated Kit outputs change through source, generator or command contract]
    NOTE3[Metrics are evidence, not authority]
    NOTE4[Lab gates do not prove main-repository conformance]

    NOTE1 -. governs .-> RISK
    NOTE2 -. boundary .-> FAST
    NOTE3 -. boundary .-> RECORD
    NOTE4 -. boundary .-> PASS
